0.00 -12.00 TD
(authority of correcting / altering / withdrawing the result at any time. Any comments from the Head of Institutes regarding the published result should be reported in written within 03 November, 2025. No) Tj
0.00 -12.00 TD
(complain will be entertained after the expiry of the stipulated time.) Tj
0.00 -12.00 TD
